  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a weapon to give it an icy chill that sometimes slows its target."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle et våben permanent, så det får en isnende kulde, der til tider bremser målet.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a weapon to grant a chance to gain Insight when you cast a spell, which gives +100% Spirit for a short duration."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle et våben permanent, så der er en chance for at opnå Indsigt, når du kaster en besværgelse, hvilket giver +100% Ånd i kort tid.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a weapon to grant a chance to trigger Recovery when your attacks are dodged or parried, which heals you for 5% of your maximum health. Cannot occur more than once every 10 sec."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle et våben permanent, så der er en chance for at udløse Genopretning, når dine angreb undviges eller pareres, hvilket helbreder dig for 5% af dit maksimale helbred. Kan ikke ske mere end én gang hvert 10. sek.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a weapon to grant a chance to trigger Revelation when your direct spells fail to deal a critical strike. Revelation grants 100% increased critical strike chance to your next spell cast."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle et våben permanent, så der er en chance for at udløse Openbaring, når dine direkte besværgelser ikke rammer et kritisk slag. Openbaring giver 100% øget chance for kritisk slag på din næste besværgelse.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a weapon to grant up to 15 additional frost damage when casting frost spells."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle et våben permanent, så det giver op til 15 ekstra frostskade, når du kaster frostbesværgelser.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a weapon to have a chance of stunning and inflicting heavy damage on demons."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle et våben permanent, så det har en chance for at bedøve og påføre tung skade på dæmoner.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a weapon to increase your agility by 15."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle et våben permanent, så det øger din smidighed med 15.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a weapon to increase your intellect by 22."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle et våben permanent, så det øger dit intellekt med 22.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a weapon to increase your spirit by 22."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle et våben permanent, så det øger din ånd med 22.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a weapon to increase your strength by 15."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle et våben permanent, så det øger din styrke med 15.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a weapon to occasionally bless the wielder with incredible strength."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle et våben permanent, så det til tider velsigner bæreren med utrolig styrke.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a weapon to occasionally steal some of the health of the foe and give it to the wielder."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle et våben permanent, så det til tider stjæler noget af fjendens helbred og giver det til bæreren.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a weapon to often inflict a curse on the target which reduces their melee damage."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle et våben permanent, så det ofte påfører målet en forbandelse, der reducerer deres nærkampsskade.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant a weapon to regularly blast its target with fire."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle et våben permanent, så det jævnligt beskyder sit mål med ild.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant an Off Hand to give +12 Spirit."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle en Bihånd permanent, så den giver +12 Ånd.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant an Off Hand to give +6 Intellect and +5 Spirit."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle en Bihånd permanent, så den giver +6 Intellekt og +5 Ånd.",
  ["Teaches you how to permanently enchant an Off Hand to give +9 Intellect."] = "Lærer dig at fortrylle en Bihånd permanent, så den giver +9 Intellekt.",
